Bundled third-party assets
--------------------------

Inter, the variable font by Rasmus Andersson, is bundled into the built studio through the
@fontsource-variable/inter package. Inter is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:
https://github.com/rsms/inter/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

Icons are rendered from the @marcusv/roc package (MIT); the element-kind glyphs in
src/lib/core/kind-icons.ts are copied from its outline set so exports can draw them. Runtime dependencies such as LikeC4
(MIT), elkjs (used under the EPL-2.0) and Svelte (MIT) are installed from npm under their own
licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the license files in the installed packages.
